  ImageLeft: {fileID: 0}
  Title: 'Mode Of Transmission:'
  Description: (Cloud and Bullet) Result of human intrusion into zoonotic (sylvatic)
    cycle or by entry of rodents or infected fleas into human's habitat and bite of
    infected fleas; domestic pets can carry plague-infected fleas; contact of commensal
    rodents and their fleas with sylvatic rodents may result in epizootic and epidemic
    plague; handling of infected tissues; airborne droplets from humans or pets with
    plague pneumonia; careless manipulation of laboratory cultures; person-to-person
    transmission by human fleas.
